an Furth</surname><given-names>EF</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoek</surname><given-names>HW</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Time Trends in the Incidence of Eating Disorders: A Primary Care Study in the Netherlands.</article-title><source>Int J Eat Disord</source><volume>39</volume><fpage>565</fpage><lpage>569</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16791852</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001541-Keel1"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Keel</surname><given-names>PK</given-names></name><name><surname>Heatherton</surname><given-names>TF</given-names></name><name><surname>Dorer</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Joiner</surname><given-names>TE</given-names></name><name><surname>Zalta</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Point prevalence of bulimia nervosa in 1982, 1992, and 2002.</article-title><source>Psychol Med</source><volume>36</volume><fpage>119</fpage><lpage>127</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16202192</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001541-Hudson1"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hudson</surname><given-names>JI</given-names></name><name><surname>Pope</surname><given-names>HG</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>Kessler</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>The Prevalence and Correlates of Eating Disorders in the National Comorbidity Survey Replication.</article-title><source>Biol Psychiatry</source><volume>61</volume><fpage>348</fpage><lpage>358</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16815322</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001541-Wells1"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wells</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Bro